  - id: R:reflection/common-sense-khanmigo
    type: reflection
    name: Common Sense Media on Khanmigo
    summary: "A risk assessment (last updated 8 August 2024) rates Khanmigo low risk and labels it designed for kids, praising responsible AI guidelines, transparency and limited conversation scope. It flags speculative answers in the historical-figures activity and unreliable facts."
